{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17607","headline":"郡中翫月寄江南李少尹虞部孟员外三首 一 · 羊士谔","name":"郡中翫月寄江南李少尹虞部孟员外三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月满自高丘，江通无狭流。\n轩窗开到晓，风物坐含秋。\n鹊警银河断，蛩悲翠幕幽。\n清光望不极，耿耿下西楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}